<lb n="p1c_XLIII.001"/>
<hi rendition="#aq">a</hi>) dramatisirte, <hi rendition="#aq">b</hi>) Briefe, <hi rendition="#aq">c</hi>) elegische Jdylle, <hi rendition="#aq">d</hi>) <hi rendition="#g">Sonnet</hi> <lb n="p1c_XLIII.002"/>
