umbras Erebi, noctemque profundam, ante pudor <lb n="p1c_306.010"/>
quam te violem, aut tua iura resolvam. <hi rendition="#g">Virg.</hi> &#x2500; <lb n="p1c_306.011"/>
Di meliora ferant. <hi rendition="#g">Tibull.</hi> Di talem terris avertite <lb n="p1c_306.012"/>
pestem. &#x2500; Di meliora piis, erroremque hostibus <lb n="p1c_306.013"/>
illum. <hi rendition="#g">Virg.</hi> &#x2500; Ante pererratis amborum finibus <lb n="p1c_306.014"/>
exul aut Ararim Parthus bibet aut Germania Tigrim, <lb n="p1c_306.015"/>
quam nostro illius labatur pectore vultus! &#x2500; <lb n="p1c_306.016"/>
<hi rendition="#g">Idem</hi></hi>. Hierher gehört der <hi rendition="#g">Schwur,</hi> der bey den Dichtern <lb n="p1c_306.017"/>
